--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -34,6 +34,8 @@ You can find our backwards-compatibility policy [here](https://github.com/hynek/
 
   [#657](https://github.com/hynek/structlog/pull/657)
 
+- `structlog.processors.ExceptionRenderer` (and therefore `structlog.processors.format_exc_info` and `structlog.processors.dict_tracebacks`) doesn't add an `exception` key anymore if there is no exception -- for example, if `exception()` is called outside of an exception handler.
